think The cold roster pass was launched detached at the front of the lap, before any commit or edit, so its tree_digest could hold still. I made no edit while it ran.
think The pass finished with tree_moved=no and run_verdict=guard_red. Of 541 guards, 490 were green, 48 red, 3 gated, 0 unrun. The red names include dated_path, exec_bit, unshared_citation, room_bound, and rye_toolchain_resolve among 48 in all.
think The grade of recursion-prompts/grass-inner.md at Field, with service 80 and truth 100 hand-entered, composes to B+ (87). Register 77 and reach 90 were counted; service 80 is my own judgment, not a measurement.
obs No red was repaired this lap. Forty-eight reds across many subjects is a ledger-sized finding, and booking rows would need fetch-before-book on REDS numbers and a claim for each repair. That work sits beyond one grade lap, so it is left to a check-in rather than started here.
obs Nothing was pushed. The send rule asks for a GREEN witness before shipping code, and this lap ships no code, so the log lands as a local commit only.
